# OPTIONAL. The dashboard works without it - the database gates access in
# admin_dashboard(). Setting it moves the role check into the route handler
# and lets you revoke the function from `authenticated`, which makes the
# analytics unreachable from any browser.
#
# Server only. It must NEVER be prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ - that would ship it in
# the browser bundle. See ANALYTICS.md, "The two deployment postures".
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
